Changes made here
  Produced from the upstream tab-separated release (From / To / Votes) by
  scripts/tsk_convert.py. The data has been:

    - reformatted to JSON keyed by source passage key, each value a list of
      [reference, votes] pairs — {"GEN.1.1": [["PRO.8.22-30", 59], ...]}
    - re-expressed in this project's passage-key grammar (SPEC §3)
    - filtered by a minimum vote threshold and truncated to the top N
      references per source verse
    - reduced by dropping rows that fail validation against the versification
      table in scripts/books.json

  It is therefore a subset of the upstream dataset, not a complete copy. No
  cross-reference has been added, and no vote count altered.
